e value of the county&rsquo;s 4 grids, November to December came in under 90% of normal in 38 of those years, more than any other pair. In 2025 the middle ran 187% of normal in April to May and 51% in January to February. Every grid had its driest year in 1963, and grid 16934 bottomed out at 45% that year.</p>"}
